# The invariants of stage 6d in QEMU (TASK-21): t_posix's checks through
# libposix, the broker, ttyd and tmpd, run from dash; then the Ctrl-C of
# INV-0105-1 with a foreground job of three and a background job of two.
! panicked
! ZORAYA-PANIC
! ZORAYA-FAULT
! FAIL
< PSURF>
> t_posix forkpos\r
< t_posix: forkpos passed
< PSURF>
> t_posix cloexec\r
< t_posix: cloexec passed
< PSURF>
> t_posix execwait\r
< t_posix: execwait passed
< PSURF>
> t_posix groups\r
< t_posix: groups passed
< PSURF>
> t_posix tcsetpgrp\r
< t_posix: tcsetpgrp passed
< PSURF>
